# ============================================================
#  Spells (design §9.1; docs/spells-v2-list.md, revision 2).
#  Ids are the combat minigame's (combat/setup/roster.mjs, SPELLS).
#  skill: the skill it trains when learned and adds to on checks · verb: the one verb its cards use
#  cost: Mana per level (three levels for a course spell, else one), the same in a card's up[] option and in a
#  fight: the roster's SPELLS[id].cost (one Mana scale; test/combat-bridge.test.js keeps them equal)
#  pool: hidden | forbidden, no source yet · alignment: taken off per cast.
# ============================================================

# ---------------- Course spells (3 levels) and Ward ----------------

@spell flame
name: Flame
discipline: evocation
skill: arcana
verb: Burn
cost: 9, 8, 7
art: spell_flame
desc: Fire from the fingertips: a candle's worth at first, a bonfire's later. Every duellist you'll ever face has it ready, and so should you.

@spell foresight
name: Foresight
discipline: astromancy
skill: lore
verb: Foresee
cost: 7, 6, 5
art: spell_foresight
desc: A glimpse of the next few moments. Enough to know which way the dice will fall, sometimes.

@spell mend
name: Mend
discipline: alchemy
skill: alchemy
verb: Mend
cost: 9, 8, 7
art: spell_mend
desc: Knits cuts, cracks and broken teacups. Hearts take longer.

@spell glamour
name: Glamour
discipline: illusion
skill: charm
verb: Glamour
cost: 9, 7, 5
art: spell_glamour
desc: A little more charm than you really have. People remember liking you and not quite why.

@spell haste
name: Haste
discipline: beastcraft
skill: vigor
verb: Hasten
cost: 5, 5, 5
art: spell_haste
desc: Speed borrowed from hares and hawks. You act first; you pay for it with a long nap.

@spell shadowstep
name: Shadowstep
discipline: umbral
skill: guile
verb: Step
cost: 8, 10, 12
art: spell_shadowstep
desc: Step into one shadow and out of another. Short distances only; the shadows in between are not friendly.

@spell ward
name: Ward
verb: Ward
cost: 7
art: spell_ward
desc: A pale shell that turns aside the next harm. Every first-year is taught it in the first week, before anything else, and told to keep it close.

# ---------------- Hidden courses (1 level) ----------------

@spell animate
name: Animate
discipline: artifice
skill: alchemy arcana
verb: Animate
cost: 14
art: spell_animate
desc: A made thing gets up and moves by itself: a broom that sweeps, a chair that follows. It does one thing, and keeps doing it.

@spell starlight
name: Starlight
discipline: starcalling
skill: lore
verb: Illuminate
cost: 9
art: spell_starlight
desc: The light of a named star, held in the hand. Darkness that eats light finds it hard to swallow.

@spell seal
name: Seal
discipline: hollow_studies
skill: guile
verb: Seal
cost: 8
art: spell_seal
desc: Closes what is open and locks it away: a box, a door, a spell half-spent. What's sealed stays where you put it.

# ---------------- Peer capstones (1 level) ----------------

@spell wildfire
name: Wildfire
skill: arcana
verb: Burn
cost: 8
art: spell_wildfire
desc: Fire you stop holding small. It grows while you hold it and runs when you let go, and it never quite forgets you're there.

@spell heartwood
name: Heartwood
skill: vigor
verb: Root
cost: 14
art: spell_heartwood
desc: A young tree out of bare ground, grown in a breath to stand over you. It shelters whoever stands under it.

@spell omen
name: Omen
skill: lore
verb: Foretell
cost: 8
art: spell_omen
desc: Say what will happen, out loud, and it lands. Not soon; but it lands.

@spell sleight
name: Sleight
skill: guile
verb: Lift
cost: 4
alignment: tiny
art: spell_sleight
desc: Palm, swap, pocket. A coin walks out of a purse and into yours, and nobody saw a thing. It is still theft.

@spell contraption
name: Contraption
skill: alchemy
verb: Build
cost: 10
art: spell_contraption
desc: A machine out of whatever is in reach, that works at once and mostly as meant. Stand back when it stops.

@spell hoarfrost
name: Hoarfrost
skill: arcana
verb: Freeze
cost: 7
art: spell_hoarfrost
desc: Cold called down hard: it freezes, cools and quenches. Set against a flame, the two of them cancel out.

@spell candour
name: Candour
skill: charm
verb: Confess
cost: 6
art: spell_candour
desc: Ask the right question and get the honest answer, sometimes more honest than anyone wanted.

# ---------------- Club and job spells (1 level) ----------------

@spell brace
name: Brace
skill: vigor
verb: Brace
cost: 10
art: spell_brace
desc: Plant your feet and hold. The first blow breaks on you, and the next few land softer.

@spell quickquill
name: Quickquill
skill: guile
verb: Scribble
cost: 4
art: spell_quickquill
desc: A quill that takes it all down, word for word, as fast as anyone can talk. It has opinions about your handwriting.

@spell bramble
name: Bramble
skill: alchemy
verb: Entangle
cost: 10
art: spell_bramble
desc: A hedge or a vine, now, where there wasn't one. The thorns are not for decoration.

@spell index
name: Index
skill: lore
verb: Recall
cost: 4
art: spell_index
desc: Find the page. Any book you've held falls open where you need it, and a library starts to make sense.

@spell rapport
name: Rapport
skill: charm
verb: Befriend
cost: 4
art: spell_rapport
desc: The right joke at the right moment. A room that was about to turn on you laughs instead.

@spell purify
name: Distil
skill: alchemy
verb: Distil
cost: 0
art: spell_distil
desc: Draws out and concentrates: the strength from a root, the magic from yourself. It costs no Mana; it costs you.

@spell tailwind
name: Tailwind
skill: vigor
verb: Surge
cost: 5
art: spell_tailwind
desc: Go fast, then faster. The wind gets behind you and keeps pushing as long as you don't stop.

# ---------------- Hidden pool (no source yet) ----------------

@spell rime
name: Rime
skill: arcana
verb: Freeze
cost: 4
pool: hidden
art: spell_rime
desc: A sliver of winter sewn into your collar. The blow that should fell you finds you frozen instead, and you thaw.

@spell reflect
name: Reflect
skill: lore
verb: Reflect
cost: 8
pool: hidden
art: spell_reflect
desc: What is thrown at you goes back where it came from, all of it.

@spell moonwell
name: Moonwell
skill: alchemy
verb: Gather
cost: 0
pool: hidden
art: spell_moonwell
desc: Sit still and let magic pool in you, like moonlight in a basin. It is slow, and it is free.

@spell lodestar
name: Lodestar
skill: lore
verb: Gather
cost: 4
pool: hidden
art: spell_lodestar
desc: Gather a guiding light around you, a little more each breath, until it is ready to stand between you and harm.

@spell toll
name: Toll
verb: Toll
cost: 0
pool: hidden
art: spell_toll
desc: One low note, held, like a bell heard under water. Nobody teaches it.

# ---------------- Forbidden pool (no source yet; alignment per cast) ----------------

@spell torment
name: Torment
skill: guile
verb: Torment
cost: 14
pool: forbidden
alignment: small
art: spell_torment
desc: Every move your opponent makes hurts them. It is forbidden for good reason.

@spell extraction
name: Extraction
skill: arcana
verb: Extract
cost: 10
pool: forbidden
alignment: small
art: spell_extraction
desc: Reach into someone and take their magic for yours. Forbidden, and everyone who has felt it remembers.

@spell siphon
name: Siphon
skill: alchemy
verb: Siphon
cost: 12
pool: forbidden
alignment: small
art: spell_siphon
desc: Draw the life out of someone, slowly, and keep it. Forbidden.

@spell compel
name: Compel
skill: guile
verb: Compel
cost: 16
pool: forbidden
alignment: small
art: spell_compel
desc: Make someone do again what they just did, whether they want to or not. Forbidden.

@spell eclipse
name: Eclipse
skill: arcana
verb: Convert
cost: 6
pool: forbidden
alignment: small
art: spell_eclipse
desc: Pain taken becomes power held. You still feel all of it. Forbidden.

@spell heartprice
name: Heartprice
skill: vigor
verb: Sacrifice
cost: 0
pool: forbidden
alignment: small
art: spell_heartprice
desc: Pay for magic with your own strength instead of Mana, for as long as you can stand it. Forbidden.
